Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.60,0:00:08.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh my, that looks quite good on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.30,0:00:12.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In all my years, I've never received\Nsuch a strange request for clothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.34,0:00:14.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the pleasure was mine, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.32,0:00:17.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, I gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.92,0:00:19.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep the change. See ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.26,0:00:22.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.14,0:00:26.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.36,0:00:27.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.62,0:00:31.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And don't you dare touch me there,\Nyou—Hey, don't say it like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.34,0:00:32.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I don't wanna!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.50,0:00:34.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanna keep going with you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.26,0:00:36.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, little miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.88,0:00:38.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not vacationing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.82,0:00:42.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My daughter, Jotaro's mother, is\Nin grave danger at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.68,0:00:48.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're on this journey to save my\Ndaughter's life, not to put yours at risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.74,0:00:51.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forget this running away\Nbusiness and start heading home.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.02,0:00:55.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure your parents are worried\Nsick, wondering where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.52,0:00:56.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.54,0:00:57.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.45,0:00:58.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose so.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.52,0:01:01.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll make you look good\Nthis time, Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.60,0:01:05.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.51,0:01:06.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.86,0:01:08.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.22,0:01:11.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.30,0:01:13.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Life is just a bunch of goodbyes anyway!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.18,0:01:21.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do sort of wish I could have seen\Nhim once more before I had to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.38,0:01:33.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodbye! Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.38,0:01:34.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better save your mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.06,0:01:36.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're all counting on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.94,0:01:38.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be cheering you on!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.84,0:02:03.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.66,0:02:46.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll see you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.78,0:02:51.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.44,0:02:55.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koubushi kanatsu Zainar
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.72,0:02:58.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with Vision Star and Cloud
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.70,0:03:18.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pakistan is a young country.
