Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.26,0:03:36.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the people carry on the 5,000-year\Nhistory of the Indian subcontinent.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:39.15,0:03:43.78,Title 3,ep,0,0,0,,{\fad(776,642)\pos(192,815)}Episode 14: Justice, Part 1
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.46,0:03:42.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta say, Jotaro,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.66,0:03:46.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm impressed you got a Japanese\Nschool uniform made here in Pakistan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.88,0:03:48.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fit is perfect, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.86,0:03:50.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's 100% wool.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.16,0:03:53.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Polnareff, are you\Nokay driving right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.96,0:03:56.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fog in this area\Nis getting quite thick.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.68,0:03:59.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These aren't exactly\Nthe safest conditions.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.76,0:04:04.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's one hell of a drop off the right\Nside, and there's no guardrail anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.26,0:04:07.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, the fog looks even thicker up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.30,0:04:13.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not even three o'clock\Nyet, but we should head in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.24,0:04:16.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's find a place to stay\Nin that town for the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.14,0:04:18.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think they have nice hotels?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.98,0:04:20.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice hotel, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.56,0:04:23.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right, and it better\Nhave a decent bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.76,0:04:24.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.67,0:04:26.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just couldn't get used\Nto the really strange
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.50,0:04:29.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,toilets they have all over\NIndia and the Middle East.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.62,0:04:35.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.88,0:04:37.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was that a dead dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.84,0:04:39.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Jotaro?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.02,0:04:42.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh, it was nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.76,0:04:43.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.18,0:04:54.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, this is a nice little town. Don't\Nyou think there must be at least a few
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.26,0:04:59.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thousand people living here let's ask\Nabout a hotel at that restaurant over
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.94,0:05:06.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There but there's a weird quiet about
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.64,0:05:09.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this place no matter where we've gone
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.62,0:05:14.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every other place has been rowdy and\Ncongested it's probably because of the Fog.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.14,0:05:17.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen up, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.66,0:05:22.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In Pakistan and the rest of the Islamic\Nworld, this is how you greet people.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.28,0:05:27.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First, you smile and\Nsay, As-Salaam-Alay-Koom.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.42,0:05:46.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, no harm intended.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.84,0:05:49.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No need to close up shop just for us, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.60,0:05:51.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just wanted to ask a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.58,0:05:53.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are there any hotels here in town?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:55.79,0:05:55.83,SFX,1,0,0,0,,{=17}{\blur0.7\fade(255,0,255,0,0,770,1370)\frz354.8\pos(1884.8,664.6)\clip(m 1760 648 l 1701 693 1650 756 1561 904 1574 555)\c&H353331&}Silence
