Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.52,0:06:03.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anybody home?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.06,0:06:06.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do not know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.54,0:06:08.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good day. Hey, wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.78,0:06:10.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean you don't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.74,0:06:24.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh what's with that\Nguy that can't be right
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.44,0:06:27.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i must have imagined\Nit i'm sure he couldn't
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.60,0:06:29.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,understand you because\Nyour pronunciation's
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.64,0:06:32.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so bad let's just go\Nask that guy over there
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.44,0:06:36.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,excuse me sorry but we're\Nlooking for a hotel around
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.66,0:06:39.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,here preferably a hotel\Nwith nice clean bathrooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.98,0:06:41.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know any of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.92,0:06:48.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Hey you! What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.48,0:06:56.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.94,0:06:59.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.14,0:07:02.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With that look of fear on his face!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.82,0:07:03.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.06,0:07:06.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is he lying dead in the road?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.18,0:07:07.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What could have killed him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.68,0:07:08.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A heart attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.90,0:07:15.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A stroke, it's possible, but look what\Nwe've got here — it's no ordinary heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.26,0:07:20.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Failure it's a gun wait a minute this
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.70,0:07:24.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,guy's holding a gun you just noticed Check
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.62,0:07:29.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it out it's still smoking he must have\Njust fired it maybe two to five Minutes
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.98,0:07:33.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ago either way he must have died
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.32,0:07:36.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right before we arrived in town do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.02,0:07:38.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think he shot himself?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.90,0:07:39.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I doubt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.04,0:07:44.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His body doesn't seem to have any visible\Nwounds, and there's no blood anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.28,0:07:45.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then how'd this guy die?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.86,0:07:46.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't natural!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.98,0:07:47.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at him!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.89,0:07:51.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His face is all twisted, like\Nhe was screaming another terror!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.02,0:07:52.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Astounding.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.16,0:07:56.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta wonder who or what\Nhe shot at with that gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.24,0:07:57.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What exactly happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.54,0:07:59.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't anyone here see anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.14,0:08:00.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one stopped to help!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.66,0:08:02.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me! Ma 'am, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.76,0:08:04.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone has died here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.16,0:08:05.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please call the police!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.28,0:08:19.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pardon me, young man.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.82,0:08:22.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My boils seem to be festering today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.02,0:08:25.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.06,0:08:27.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You had a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.72,0:08:29.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was it that you needed?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.52,0:08:33.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I asked if you could please\Ncall the police, ma 'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.68,0:08:34.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The police?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.18,0:08:38.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What would I do that for?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.32,0:08:41.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, that man's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.78,0:08:47.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone is dead, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.78,0:08:49.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How terribly unfortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.12,0:08:53.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure if there is\Nanything I can do about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.44,0:08:55.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I already asked you to\Ncall the police twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.98,0:08:57.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, call the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.84,0:08:59.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think you did say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.68,0:09:01.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, good day, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.84,0:09:03.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My boils are infected.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.82,0:09:07.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They are so itchy, so terribly itchy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.48,0:09:13.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is with the people in this town?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.26,0:09:16.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a man lying dead in the street,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.90,0:09:19.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and nobody seems even the\Nslightest bit concerned.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.08,0:09:21.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't they hear the gunshot?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.82,0:09:23.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody's doing anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.12,0:09:24.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like they don't even care.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.82,0:09:29.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These people are more oblivious than\Nthe most jaded New Yorker or Tokyoite.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.10,0:09:31.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.92,0:09:36.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This blasted fog just keeps\Ngetting thicker and thicker.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.68,0:09:39.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's almost as if the fog is\Nswallowing the town whole.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.72,0:09:41.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is really creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.48,0:09:45.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Call me crazy, but doesn't that\Npart there look like a skull?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.86,0:10:03.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you want to\Ndo? You don't think it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.70,0:10:06.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,could be the work of\Nanother stand user do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.92,0:10:11.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Probably not there's no motive\Nwhy would someone who's after us
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.40,0:10:14.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,kill a man who has nothing to do\Nwith us before we even got here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.74,0:10:20.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's no reason for a stan user\Nto kill him who knows the way he
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.10,0:10:24.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,died is obviously unnatural let's\Nexamine the body before the police
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.10,0:10:26.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,come just try not to touch it
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.42,0:10:31.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right this might be something it
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.92,0:10:36.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,appears he was traveling too just\Nlike us he has bus and train tickets
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.10,0:10:40.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in his pocket and he looks like\Nhe might be indian he's carrying
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.28,0:10:42.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,indian money on him i'm guessing
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.30,0:10:47.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not from this town.\NOh! Look at a wound!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.92,0:10:51.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this wound he's got a gaping hole\Nhere right in his upper chest
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.56,0:10:56.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this must be what killed him hang\Non why isn't there any blood coming
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.30,0:10:59.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,out with a fatal chest wound this\Nbig there should be blood gushing
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.62,0:11:05.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,everywhere unless of course this\Nis no ordinary murder looks like
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.62,0:11:08.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,things are about to get messy\Nwe've got to get to the bottom of
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.98,0:11:11.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this it's time to search him take
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.60,0:11:17.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,off his clothes what happened to
