Dialogue: 2,0:11:15.52,0:11:15.61,SFXRed,2,0,0,0,,{=9}{\blur1\bord0\fscx127.2\fscy97.85\frz17.15\pos(1935.02,653.44)\4a&HFF&}Doom {In preview for last episode}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.32,0:11:21.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,his body there are tons of holes\Nall over this guy he's like that
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.52,0:11:24.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,cartoon cheese you see on tom and\Njerry and there's not a drop of
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.00,0:11:29.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,blood anywhere near those wounds\Nhow on earth was this man killed
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.22,0:11:34.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what does all of this mean be careful\Nthere wasn't a stand user here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.36,0:11:36.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can bet there's one here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.02,0:11:40.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone, get in the car!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.88,0:11:42.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're leaving this town now! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.00,0:11:44.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.54,0:11:46.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.36,0:11:48.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't the car!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.20,0:11:51.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.04,0:11:52.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.08,0:11:54.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hermit! Purple!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.72,0:12:07.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, old man, what in\Nthe hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.70,0:12:08.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.62,0:12:11.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.38,0:12:13.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, what am I doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.70,0:12:15.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The car was right here just a minute ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.78,0:12:16.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.69,0:12:17.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.61,0:12:19.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just parked the car\Nover there and walked.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.80,0:12:20.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.22,0:12:24.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But just now I could\Nhave sworn that... Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.68,0:12:43.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, hello, good sirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.62,0:12:45.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see you are travelers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.26,0:12:49.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid with this fog, it's\Ndangerous to leave the town now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.44,0:12:51.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are many cliffs, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.26,0:12:54.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I run my own bed and\Nbreakfast not far from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.26,0:12:57.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you'd like, why not\Nstay there for the night?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.94,0:12:59.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's plenty of room for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.02,0:13:02.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll even give you a healthy discount.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.80,0:13:03.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finally!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.71,0:13:06.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've actually met a\Nnormal person for once.
