Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.92,0:13:20.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to assume a stand user\Nis hiding somewhere in this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.26,0:13:23.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With this fog, there's no\Ntelling what our enemy could do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.68,0:13:25.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They could be next to\Nus, and we wouldn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.54,0:13:28.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We absolutely cannot let\Nour guard down tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.68,0:13:32.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, guys, I realize no\None's attacked us quite yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.22,0:13:33.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but damn, this town is creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.76,0:13:36.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.78,0:13:38.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This way, Master Joestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.64,0:13:41.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That building over there\Nis my bed and breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.50,0:13:44.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Follow me, and I'll\Nshow you to your rooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.20,0:13:45.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try not to fall behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.48,0:13:49.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it doesn't look like\Nmuch, but it has history.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.56,0:13:53.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,About 20 years ago, one of the\N007 movies was filmed here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.00,0:13:57.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And when John Lennon of the\NBeatles visited the country,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.08,0:14:02.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he spent the entire time in our\Nlittle hotel. What? Seriously? Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.26,0:14:04.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just pulling your leg, young man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.52,0:14:05.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.43,0:14:06.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still, it is quite a lovely hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.82,0:14:09.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've put my heart and soul into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.28,0:14:13.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't have any other guests at the\Nmoment, so you can pick the dinner menu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.48,0:14:14.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you prefer meat?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.62,0:14:16.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If not, we have fresh fish available.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.80,0:14:18.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a second, Grandma.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.84,0:14:21.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ma, before, you called\Nme Joestar, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.50,0:14:25.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did you know my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.16,0:14:40.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come now, that delightful\Nyoung man next to you said Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.80,0:14:41.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.06,0:14:44.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I may be old, but my ears still work.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.36,0:14:45.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.27,0:14:47.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I said it, but I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.94,0:14:49.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, you did, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.76,0:14:53.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you've been working in this\Nbusiness for as many years as I have?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.52,0:14:56.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you really learned to memorize\Npeople's names quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.24,0:14:58.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I'm sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.12,0:15:01.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, ma 'am, I\Njust noticed the bandages.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.02,0:15:03.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened to your hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.48,0:15:04.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.58,0:15:06.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A minor burn, nothing more.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.64,0:15:12.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose it's just my old age, but I\Naccidentally spilled boiling water on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.50,0:15:14.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't be silly, madame.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.42,0:15:17.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You hardly look a day over 40,\Nand that's God's honest truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.76,0:15:20.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you say you\Nand I get dinner alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.94,0:15:22.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you naughty boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.60,0:15:24.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tease an old woman like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.30,0:15:30.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You damn babbling, pathetic fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.20,0:15:34.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is you I despise most, Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.20,0:15:38.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll make you suffer a pain 1,000\Ntimes worse than what my son endured.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.22,0:15:43.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I'll cut off your dick and rip\Nout your guts to finish you off.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.34,0:15:47.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.25,0:15:48.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This doesn't look bad at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.66,0:15:51.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, Kakyoin. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.94,0:15:55.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My autograph's worth as much as Lennon's.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.48,0:15:56.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.39,0:15:57.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Paul Nareff, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.84,0:15:59.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make sure you take care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.68,0:16:01.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.59,0:16:04.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure it's\Npreserved for all time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.40,0:16:07.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To commemorate the day I murder you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.98,0:16:08.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.16,0:16:13.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well then, allow me to show\Nyou to your rooms, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.58,0:16:24.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh man, talk about a weird town.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.14,0:16:29.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now time to hit the loo!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.06,0:16:34.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think it's functional.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.20,0:16:36.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, if that's the case,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.28,0:16:39.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't be able to use Hermit\NPurple to get info on the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.38,0:16:40.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.64,0:16:42.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar, what's the look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.74,0:16:44.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My room doesn't have a bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.30,0:16:46.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there one in here I can use?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.14,0:16:48.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps the bathroom here is communal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.22,0:16:50.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.14,0:16:52.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's so carefree.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.56,0:16:53.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good grief!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.58,0:16:56.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A stand user could attack at any moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.70,0:16:58.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He should be on guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.26,0:17:19.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, the Joestar party\Nis on the third floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.42,0:17:22.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe me and my six-shooter\Nought to pay them a visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.58,0:17:24.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, Hall Force.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.28,0:17:27.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you've come. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.60,0:17:31.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I finally managed to track those sorry\Nbastards as far as this creepy town.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.60,0:17:33.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But finding you is surprising, Enya.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.24,0:17:37.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't think you'd come all\Nthe way out here yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.56,0:17:50.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Nyabba?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.36,0:17:51.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did I say something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.38,0:17:55.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.82,0:17:57.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just happy, whole horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.14,0:18:00.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It means so much that you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.90,0:18:04.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for coming to\Nsee this lonely old woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.64,0:18:08.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is so wonderful to finally see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.60,0:18:13.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me something.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.24,0:18:17.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and my son were friends,\Nwere you not, Cold Horse?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.74,0:18:18.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Were we friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.00,0:18:20.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, well, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.54,0:18:23.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, we're thick as thieves, ma 'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.12,0:18:26.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you were close?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.00,0:18:29.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we were practically brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.36,0:18:31.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was a dear friend and\Nan excellent partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.04,0:18:33.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this all about?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.50,0:18:36.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You aren't acting like\Nyourself at all in Yoma.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.16,0:18:40.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His death must weigh heavily on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.96,0:18:42.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will you avenge him?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.38,0:18:43.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that why you're here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.18,0:18:46.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's exactly it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.42,0:18:50.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna make sure those bastards\Npay for killing my best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.96,0:18:55.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's exactly what I want to hear!
