Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.98,0:19:03.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because now I can kill you\Ntoo, you filthy traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.66,0:19:07.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yoma, what the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.92,0:19:17.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Idiot, isn't it obvious?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.74,0:19:19.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You abandoned him to save yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.72,0:19:22.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swore I would kill you\Nthe moment I saw you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.52,0:19:24.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You deserve the same as the Joestars.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.86,0:19:28.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you call yourself his\Nbest friend, cretin, Judas?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.88,0:19:30.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, you got it all wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.62,0:19:34.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the time I got there, Sinnerfall\Nwas already a goner, honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.36,0:19:41.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wretch, you're as unforgivable\Nas that bastard Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.96,0:19:45.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll have you die at the\Nhands of my stand, Justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.84,0:19:47.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, have mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.84,0:19:57.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only a few have seen the\Nterrifying power of my stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.76,0:20:02.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now you will join all of\Nthem in death, whole horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.20,0:20:07.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.18,0:20:09.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is happening\Nto the blood of my arm?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.62,0:20:11.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like it's all just evaporating.
