Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.30,0:20:20.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It made such a fine wound, did it not?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.10,0:20:25.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right. This is Justice,\Na Stand that's made of fog.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.34,0:20:31.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any wound my stand happens to graze,\Nbecomes a gaming hole, and then...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.32,0:20:38.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Justice wants to dance, whole horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.40,0:20:43.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My stance fog has entered\Nyour arm like a string,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.88,0:20:47.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and now you're a helpless puppet\NI can do with as I please.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.72,0:20:51.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will die by your\Nown hand, whole horse!
