Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.60,0:20:59.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.72,0:21:03.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't get so damn cocky! Emperor!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.82,0:21:06.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Die, you crazy old hag!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.30,0:21:13.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Justice prevails.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.00,0:21:15.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.91,0:21:17.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell was that noise?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.66,0:21:19.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounded like a giant explosion.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.68,0:21:23.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It came from the room at the\Nback of the downstairs lobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.82,0:21:35.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong Polnareff huh we heard\Nsomething strange and came to investigate.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.14,0:21:38.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Same here i was about to\Ncheck downstairs i'll look
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.60,0:21:41.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in the lobby first call\Nme if you find anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.08,0:21:41.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.68,0:21:53.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your time's finally come, Ponareth.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.74,0:22:14.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the old paintings on the tomb.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:12.18,0:22:14.60,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,All the old paintings on the tomb
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.52,0:22:16.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They do the sand dance don't you know.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:14.60,0:22:16.85,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They do the sand dance, don'tcha know?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.56,0:22:18.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you move too quick.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:16.85,0:22:18.31,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,If they move too quick
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.76,0:22:21.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're falling down like a domino.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:19.10,0:22:21.56,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They're falling down like a domino
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.26,0:22:23.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the birds are men by the Nile.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:21.56,0:22:23.90,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,All the bazaar men by the Nile
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.90,0:22:25.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've got the money on a bed.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:23.90,0:22:26.24,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They got the money on a bet
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.92,0:22:27.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Called crocodiles.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:26.24,0:22:27.74,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Gold crocodiles
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.56,0:22:30.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They snap their teeth on your cigarette.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:28.41,0:22:30.87,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They snap their teeth on your cigarette
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.52,0:22:32.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Foreign types with a hookah. I say.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:30.87,0:22:33.08,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Foreign types with their hookah pipes say
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.02,0:22:41.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Walk like an Egyptian.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:40.08,0:22:42.63,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Walk like an Egyptian
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.34,0:22:56.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The blonde waitresses take their trays.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:54.01,0:22:56.47,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,The blonde waitresses take their trays
Dialogue: 1,0:22:56.47,0:22:58.85,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They spin around and they cross the floor
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.52,0:22:58.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spin around and they cross the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.52,0:23:00.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've got the moves. Oh-hey-oh.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:58.85,0:23:00.10,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They've got the moves
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.06,0:23:03.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You drop your drink then\Nthey bring you more.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.15,0:23:03.48,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,You drop your drink then they bring you more
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.18,0:23:05.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the school kids so sick of books.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:03.48,0:23:05.82,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,All the school kids so sick of books
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.82,0:23:07.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're like the punk and the metal band.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:05.82,0:23:08.15,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They like the punk and the metal band
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.88,0:23:12.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When the buzzer rings they're\Nwalking like an Egyptian.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:08.15,0:23:09.61,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,When the buzzer rings
Dialogue: 1,0:23:10.45,0:23:12.78,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They're walking like an Egyptian
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.12,0:23:14.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the kids in the marketplace say.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:12.78,0:23:14.99,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,All the kids in the marketplace say
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.78,0:23:15.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Walk
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.69,0:23:22.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like
Dialogue: 1,0:23:22.13,0:23:25.21,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Walk like an Egyptian
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.86,0:23:23.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,an Egyptian.
