Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.52,0:23:30.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's in the bathroom but he's\Nbeen in there for some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.76,0:23:32.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course he's taking a shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.32,0:23:34.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bathroom is at the end of the hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.46,0:23:36.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought I just heard the word toilet.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.14,0:23:37.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you giggling about?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.04,0:23:40.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why am I always getting\Nambushed in bathrooms?
